{"wakenudge":{"description":"Free, open-source Android alarm clock with wake-up missions (math, QR code, NFC, steps, squats), a still-awake check and a reliable lock-screen alarm. Offline, no ads, no tracking. Kotlin, Jetpack Compose and Material You.","screenshots":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/riyadmondol2006/WakeNudge/main/fastlane/metadata/android/en-US/images/phoneScreenshots/1_alarms.png","https://raw.githubusercontent.com/riyadmondol2006/WakeNudge/main/fastlane/metadata/android/en-US/images/phoneScreenshots/2_edit_alarm.png","https://raw.githubusercontent.com/riyadmondol2006/WakeNudge/main/fastlane/metadata/android/en-US/images/phoneScreenshots/3_missions.png","https://raw.githubusercontent.com/riyadmondol2006/WakeNudge/main/fastlane/metadata/android/en-US/images/phoneScreenshots/5_ring_screen.png"]}}